<title>PORTUGAL: PORTUGAL'S INE TO ISSUE JULY CPI FIGURES THURSDAY.</title>
<headline>PORTUGAL'S INE TO ISSUE JULY CPI FIGURES THURSDAY.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) will issue the consumer price index (CPI) for July on Thursday at 1000 GMT, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>Analysts predict a year-on-year rate of 1.7-1.8 percent, in line with June's 1.8 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
